{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-09-16T11:43:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T15:33:37Z","closed_at":"2026-09-16T19:06:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123546","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123546.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123546.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-16T19:06:51Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #111039\r\n\r\n`ClassDB::class_get_default_property_value()` calculates a class's default property values upon the first call and writes them to two static structures: `default_values` and `default_values_cached`. It does not acquire any locks, whereas 66 other functions in the same file acquire a `Locker::Lock`. In other words, ClassDB was designed to use locking, but this specific subsystem was left out, and the function is called from worker threads. Property defaults are resolved when a resource is being registered/imported. Consequently, if two fonts are imported simultaneously, two threads enter this function at the same time.\r\n\r\nThe two independent backtraces in #111039 point to a crash in this exact function.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nHow to fix it:\r\n\r\nWe need to add the locking code at the beginning of the function, just like the other 66 functions in the file:\r\n`Locker::Lock lock(Locker::STATE_WRITE);`\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\nTested on Windows only.\r\n\r\nAI disclosure\r\nI found the bug using Claude, and it provided the solution directly; since it was just a single line of code, there wasn't much for me to do regarding the fix itself. I handled the verification and testing.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123546/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123546/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}